# BuildKit picks up this file automatically for Dockerfile.service
# (Dockerfile-specific ignore: <dockerfile-name>.dockerignore).
#
# The service image only needs the Gradle-built bootJars from the repository
# root context. Exclude everything else to keep the context small and to make
# sure no secrets, credentials or local config ever reach an image layer.
**
# Re-include only the service bootJars (verified working with BuildKit;
# `-plain.jar` variants are never selected because JAR_PATH is explicit).
!main-vpc/**/build/libs/*.jar
!ai-vpc/**/build/libs/*.jar
!fep-vpc/**/build/libs/*.jar
!mock-vpc/**/build/libs/*.jar
